  "label": "Plane as Symbol of Death or Disappearance",
  "description": "The image of a plane taking off is used metaphorically to represent death or disappearance. This is a common trope in dark humor and satire, where the grandeur of flight is juxtaposed with the finality of death. Understanding this metaphor requires knowledge of cultural symbolism and visual metaphors in media and memes.",
